body:
When using a Reactant architecture, the function `getclosure(I, j, closure)` can fail for IsopycnalSkewSymmetricDiffusivity (and presumably other closures that contain field parameters). Adding an `Adapt.adapt_structure(...)` method fixes this.

A script that produces this error is [here](https://github.com/DJ4Earth/Channelanigans/blob/jlk9/error-adapt-kappaskew-0708/scripts/abernathey_channel.jl).

@wsmoses
